{"4693540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Tale", "steam_appid": 4693540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Realms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure through the lands of Norse myth. Traverse mythical forests, frozen tundras and ancient ruins filled with mystifying puzzles, precarious traps and long-forgotten mysteries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/52aa0c8772dad23178864e393e724c8a.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/52aa0c8772dad23178864e393e724c8a.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/52aa0c8772dad23178864e393e724c8a.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These lands are unforgiving, and it would be dangerous to go alone. On this adventure, you will travel alongside a friend! Discover new depths of exploration through many cooperation mechanics and triumph over the frigid north - together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/e7ef79472c9d0a63ae36d4267ed58105.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/e7ef79472c9d0a63ae36d4267ed58105.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/e7ef79472c9d0a63ae36d4267ed58105.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Channel the Divine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almighty gods preside over every facet of life in this world. As you forge your path forward, you will find ways to earn their favor. Learn to channel the thunderous might of Thor, the healing techniques of Freya or the all-reaching sight of the Allfather himself. Feel the effect through every axe swing and every arrow loosed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/04279e2534dca755c580bc3ec238b4fe.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/04279e2534dca755c580bc3ec238b4fe.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/04279e2534dca755c580bc3ec238b4fe.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover a Sinister Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep darkness is gathering over this peaceful land… one that calls out your names in prophecy and dream. Steel your heart and fortify the bond that holds you together, and you might stand a chance against the rising tide.<br>Are you ready to sacrifice everything and face the enemy?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/30eb29f9861be445c1def94f61aa16d5.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/30eb29f9861be445c1def94f61aa16d5.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/30eb29f9861be445c1def94f61aa16d5.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Realms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure through the lands of Norse myth. Traverse mythical forests, frozen tundras and ancient ruins filled with mystifying puzzles, precarious traps and long-forgotten mysteries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/52aa0c8772dad23178864e393e724c8a.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/52aa0c8772dad23178864e393e724c8a.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/52aa0c8772dad23178864e393e724c8a.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These lands are unforgiving, and it would be dangerous to go alone. On this adventure, you will travel alongside a friend! Discover new depths of exploration through many cooperation mechanics and triumph over the frigid north - together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/e7ef79472c9d0a63ae36d4267ed58105.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/e7ef79472c9d0a63ae36d4267ed58105.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/e7ef79472c9d0a63ae36d4267ed58105.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Channel the Divine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almighty gods preside over every facet of life in this world. As you forge your path forward, you will find ways to earn their favor. Learn to channel the thunderous might of Thor, the healing techniques of Freya or the all-reaching sight of the Allfather himself. Feel the effect through every axe swing and every arrow loosed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/04279e2534dca755c580bc3ec238b4fe.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/04279e2534dca755c580bc3ec238b4fe.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/04279e2534dca755c580bc3ec238b4fe.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover a Sinister Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep darkness is gathering over this peaceful land… one that calls out your names in prophecy and dream. Steel your heart and fortify the bond that holds you together, and you might stand a chance against the rising tide.<br>Are you ready to sacrifice everything and face the enemy?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/30eb29f9861be445c1def94f61aa16d5.poster.avif?t=1780350569\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/30eb29f9861be445c1def94f61aa16d5.webm?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/extras/30eb29f9861be445c1def94f61aa16d5.mp4?t=1780350569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark on an odyssey through Northern realms in this 2D couch co-op adventure. Play as siblings Torsten and Annika, using gifts from the gods to avenge your village and hunt the mysterious Ivar. Combine axe, bow, and magic to overcome mythological beasts and puzzles to save the world from darkness.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/3d3d8694c214d6a67f631c3609d7253a74ccb735/header.jpg?t=1780350569", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/8b390dc4c40205559533078a6e5f8c24bd098966/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780350569", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693540/8b390dc4c40205559533078a6e5f8c24bd098966/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780350569", "website": "https://shtatlsoft.com/the-last-tale", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.5 GHz (Intel i3-10th Gen)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 950 / AMD R7 360<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4096 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Shtatl Soft s.r.o."], "publishers": ["Shtatl Soft s.r.o."], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 39, "description": "Shared/Split Screen Co-op"}, {"id": 24, "description": "Shared/Split Screen"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55,